  - m_Id: 96053216886439936
    m_Localized: Hemingway Cigarette Authenticity Handbook
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96053359593439232
    m_Localized: 'Counterfeit Hemingway Cigarettes are common on the station. Their value, as their quality, is significantly lower than genuine Hemingway cigarettes. '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96053451670994944
    m_Localized: Lettering Issues
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96054067961053184
    m_Localized: The differences should be obvious at a glance.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96053659368734720
    m_Localized: Logo Issues
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96053957164318720
    m_Localized: Color Issues
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96053984980942848
    m_Localized: Security Seal Issues
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96054690999746560
    m_Localized: Spelling errors, misaligned text or uneven print quality on the pack, differences in color, font or missing lettering all indicate fraud.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96054818166849536
    m_Localized: Genuine
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96054861590478848
    m_Localized: Incorrect Font
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96054893702070272
    m_Localized: Incorrect Spelling
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96056281177833472
    m_Localized: Utilise color card to compare
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96054988258459648
    m_Localized: Incorrect
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96054942020452352
    m_Localized: Incorrect Example
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96056565048328192
    m_Localized: Hemingway Cigarettes are never sold without a security seal. If the security seal is missing or broken, the cigarette is a counterfeit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96057260392628224
    m_Localized: Republic Food Stamp Authenticity Handbook
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96057349144100864
    m_Localized: 'As part of the Republic''s very generous welfare initiative, Food Stamps are routinely distributed among the most needy in the Lower Levels. These can be used to buy essential items in stores backed by the Republic. Be warned, however: counterfeit Food Stamps are not unusual in the Lower Levels.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96057513896361984
    m_Localized: Look for spelling errors, obvious misaligned text. Differences in color, font or missing lettering are also common in forgeries.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96057755253391360
    m_Localized: (Incorrect if logo missing)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96058034761809920
    m_Localized: If the Food Stamp has a printed value of 160 Credits or higher, it will have a security seal. Food Stamps under 160 Credits will not have a security seal.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96058168140677120
    m_Localized: Stamp Value
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96058204379463680
    m_Localized: "Food Stamps are ONLY issued with values of:\n40 Credits, 80 Credits,\n120 Credits, 160 Credits,\n200 Credits, 240 Credits"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96058228136001536
    m_Localized: Chip
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96058254006468608
    m_Localized: 'All Food Stamps contain a chip. If the chip is missing or damaged, the Food Stamp is unusable, even if it is genuine. '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96059018745528320
    m_Localized: Immunivax Injector User Handbook
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96059108805623808
    m_Localized: A high-precision immuno-regulator developed to temporarily suppress the effects associated with the deadly auto-immune condition Sentinel Collapse.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96059345028825088
    m_Localized: Indicator Issues
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96059529305571328
    m_Localized: 'Example:'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96059675703558144
    m_Localized: Expired
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96059701712437248
    m_Localized: Empty
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96059889814388736
    m_Localized: Label Issues
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96059996320350208
    m_Localized: (Counterfeit if label is missing)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96060274918604800
    m_Localized: Correct Case ONLY
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96060400747724800
    m_Localized: "Possible Errors:\n -Spelling\n -Missing Company Name\n -Missing Product Name\n -Significant Font Discrepancy"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96060752268148736
    m_Localized: Serial Number
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96060973857423360
    m_Localized: 'All Immunivax Injector MUST have a valid seven-digit serial number. The first three digits are the batch numbers. Valid range: 1250000-4559999.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96061056065781760
    m_Localized: "Product Recall Notice (Batch Number): 250, 251, 301, 355, 385, 386, 421\n"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96061186227617792
    m_Localized: Recalled Example (UNUSABLE)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96061727754207232
    m_Localized: Body Issues
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96061800735096832
    m_Localized: If any damaged such as clearly visible cracks can be seen on the injector. It is considered to be Unusable
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96061957102944256
    m_Localized: Correct Main Colors
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96062623657541632
    m_Localized: Commissary
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96062734018068480
    m_Localized: Buy
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96062866713264128
    m_Localized: 'Redeemed Commissary Token:'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96063002021511168
    m_Localized: Redeem Valid Food Stamps
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96063130195247104
    m_Localized: Redeem All Eligible Lottery
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96063415374364672
    m_Localized: '"Power exists to uplift, not to oppress."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96064079886336000
    m_Localized: Confront
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96064044792594432
    m_Localized: Match Label
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96064603201257472
    m_Localized: Chem Finisher
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96065702779994112
    m_Localized: Deed of Ownership
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96065787035172864
    m_Localized: "This document certifies the holder as the lawful owner of the commercial property located at:\n\nLower Level, Sector 14\n\nThis deed hereby grants full ownership rights of the aforementioned property to the holder, effective immediately upon settlement of the debt as outlined in the Deeds of Agreement and upon full payment of the agreed purchase price.\n\nThe ownership of the property includes the following rights:\n\nRight to Operation and Management - Full control over, and assumed responsibility for, daily operations and activities.\nRight to Renovation or Alteration - Subject to applicable sector zoning laws and regulations.\nRight to Sell or Transfer - Subject to approval by the station’s governing authority and in accordance with all applicable rules and regulations."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96065848574001152
    m_Localized: The Shopkeeper
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96065889678180352
    m_Localized: The Landlord
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96066893626785792
    m_Localized: Lease Agreement
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96067891871137792
    m_Localized: "SECTION 1: PARTIES\nThe Landlord: (\"Landlord\"),\nThe Shopkeeper: (\"Tenant\").\n\nSECTION 2: PREMISES\nThe Landlord leases to the Tenant for the operation of a commercial business, subject to the terms and conditions outlined herein.\n\nSECTION 3: RENTAL TERMS\nRent Amount: Undetermined        \nPayment Schedule: Every Seven Days\n\nSECTION 4: FAILURE TO PAY RENT\nIf Rent is not paid by the due date, the Tenant shall be granted a one-time grace period during the term of this Agreement. Any missed Rent will be added to the following week’s Rent. Failure to pay the full adjusted amount by the following due date will constitute a breach of this Agreement.\n\nEviction Clause: If the Tenant fails to pay Rent or the adjusted Rent as outlined, the Landlord reserves the right to terminate this agreement, and initiate eviction procedures as per Station Ordinances.\n\nSECTION 5: RENT ADJUSTMENT\nRent Increase: The Landlord retains the right to adjust the Rent by up to 5% of the current Rent amount for the subsequent week."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96068981312241664
    m_Localized: Lower Levels Lottery Information
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96069071271673856
    m_Localized: The Lower Levels Lottery is finally back! Your fortune starts with a single ticket. Grab yours now!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96069114858881024
    m_Localized: How The Lottery Works
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96069224581873664
    m_Localized: The Lottery winning numbers are drawn every Saturday morning. Winning Numbers will be announced in the newspaper.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96069304206540800
    m_Localized: Lottery System
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96069332459372544
    m_Localized: 6 unique numbers from 1-49 will be drawn. You win prizes based on how many of your numbers match the six numbers drawn.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96069469126574080
    m_Localized: Example Winning Numbers
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96069476978311168
    m_Localized: Example Ticket Numbers (3 Matching Numbers)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96069672667758592
    m_Localized: 6 unique numbers from 1-49 will be drawn. You win prizes based on how many of your numbers match the six numbers drawn.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96070226617876480
    m_Localized: 6/6 Matches (Jackpot)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96070259631243264
    m_Localized: 5/6 Matches
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96070272549699584
    m_Localized: 4/6 Matches
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96070284029509632
    m_Localized: 3/6 Matches
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97530854868041728
    m_Localized: 'Mentor''s Note: Trading'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97530854897401856
    m_Localized: " 1. Drag the item to the Negotiation Counter and the Negotiation Interface will appear.\n 2. A button will appear if you are able to buy or sell the item.\n\n Clients only have a limited budget to spend at your Store.\n\nYou will automatically sell your items with a retail markup."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97530854897401857
    m_Localized: 'Mentor''s Note: Food'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97530854897401858
    m_Localized: " Food is the most traded commodity on the station.\n Keeping Food in stock is highly recommended, as Food and water prices can rise sharply during shortages. Everyone has to eat."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97530854897401859
    m_Localized: 'Mentor''s Note: After-Hours Activity'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97530854897401860
    m_Localized: " After closing the Store for the day, you should have time to visit one of the various locations around the Sector.\n You can always return to the Dumping Grounds to scavenge. You won't be able to bring much back to the Store without a backpack.\n You should also bring a bandage to patch yourself up in case you get wounded while scavenging. If you are badly hurt, you won't be able to go out for a few days."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97530854897401861
    m_Localized: 'Mentor''s Note: Buying Wholesale'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97530854897401862
    m_Localized: " Sometimes sellers offer a discount if you buy all of their items. (This is called buying \"Wholesale\".)\n\n You can still inspect each item in the offer individually."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97530854897401863
    m_Localized: 'Mentor''s Note: Contraband'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97530854897401864
    m_Localized: " Contraband includes any item that is considered illegal by the Republic. The possession or sale of Contraband carries a high risk... and a higher profit margin.\n There are 4 tiers of Contraband:\nLow Level (+{0}% Profit Margin): While technically illegal, they are generally ignored by Security unless they are out to get you.\n Mid Level (+{1}% Profit Margin): If found during Inspection, this item will be seized.\n High Level (+{2}% Profit Margin): If found during Inspection, this item will be seized and you will receive a fine.\n Critical Level (+{3}% Profit Margin): If found during Inspection, the Store will be shut down permanently and you will be immediately arrested.\nAdditionally, you will lose Reputation with Security if any Contraband is found."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97530854897401865
    m_Localized: 'Mentor''s Note: Stolen Items'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97530854897401866
    m_Localized: " It is illegal to trade in [Stolen] items. Each stolen item has Heat value, the higher the Heat, the more likely Security will recognize it on inspection. Sellers will offer a discount based on the Heat value.\n Heat slowly decreases over time."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97530854897401867
    m_Localized: 'Mentor''s Note: Security Inspection'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97530854897401868
    m_Localized: " Station Security will conduct random inspections for Contraband. Your Reputation with Security will affect the severity of your punishment when Contraband is found. Events can affect how often the Store is inspected.\n\nAdditionally, different Officers will conduct inspections differently. Some may be open to a bribe; others may not search every container."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97530854897401869
    m_Localized: Appraisal Service
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97530854897401870
    m_Localized: " Some valuable items marked as [Appraisal Item] have complex price structures. Customers will visit the Store and use your appraisal service to determine the value of their item.\n\n You will receive a base service fee for the appraisal, plus a bonus based on the precision of the appraisal.\nYou will be able to pass appraisal examinations and receive a certification that will improve your base service fee and unlock new item types to appraise."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97530854897401871
    m_Localized: -The Board
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97530854897401872
    m_Localized: 'Mentor''s Note: Events'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97530854897401873
    m_Localized: " Certain events will effect the market price of items, temporarily causing them to rise, or fall. The Newspaper will list most ongoing events.\nSome insiders can sell you tips for events before they happen."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97530854897401874
    m_Localized: 'Mentor''s Note: Barter Offer'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97530854897401875
    m_Localized: " Sometimes customers will arrive and offer to exchange items, rather than Credits.\n Barter offers cannot be negotiated unlike regular buy and sell offers.\n They are also not impacted by ongoing events."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97530854897401876
    m_Localized: 'Mentor''s Note: Display Case'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97530854897401877
    m_Localized: " On the left side of the Shutter Door, you'll find the Display Case, one of the key features of your Store.\n Depending on the type of items you place inside, you can attract one client per day looking to buy that type of item.\n For example, if you put many [Food] items and one low-value [Medical] item, a food-buying client will visit the store the next day.\n The total value of the items stored will impact the social class of the attracted client.\nUpgrading your Display Case will allow you to attract more clients.\n\n <b>Make sure to stock the Display Case before opening the Store each day.</b>\n Do not keep Contraband inside the Display Case or you will be arrested."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97530854897401878
    m_Localized: 'Mentor''s Note: Upgrades'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97530854897401879
    m_Localized: " As the days go by, you will meet various persons of interest who will offer to upgrade your Store for a price.\n These upgrades can be useful, but you must be careful when managing your cash flow and keep an eye out for the next rent payment."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97530854897401880
    m_Localized: 'Mentor''s Note: Visual Inspection'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97530854897401881
    m_Localized: " Certain items will be marked as inspectable using a Magnifying Glass.\n Use the Magnifying Glass on an inspectable item to open the Inspection Tray.\n If there's an issue with the item, you can select a reason at the bottom of the Inspection Tray UI to confront the client about it.\n <b>If the item is counterfeit, one issue is enough to confront the client.</b>\n\n If you are right, the client will adjust the price. If you are wrong, you will lose Reputation and the client may take their business elsewhere."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97530854897401882
    m_Localized: 'Mentor''s Note: Food Stamps'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97530854897401883
    m_Localized: " Food Stamps are part of a social program to help eligible Lower Level citizens and prevent civil unrest.\n Food Stamps can be redeemed and are used at the Commissary to buy Food.\n Food Stamps can carry various values. Since they can only be used to buy Food, they are often traded at a lower value for Credits.\n The Stamps are sometimes forged and sold to unsuspecting victims, who only find out after failing to redeem the Stamp."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97530854897401884
    m_Localized: 'Mentor''s Note: The Commissary'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97530854897401885
    m_Localized: " The Commissary is run by the Republic. The prices of all items sold here are fixed, and unaffected by the market.\n\n Nevertheless, while the price of goods is fixed, the availability of items is very much affected by the market.\n Only Food Stamps can be used to purchase goods at the Commissary.\n\n<u>Visit the Commissary after closing the Store to purchase goods.</u>"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97530854897401886
    m_Localized: 'Mentor''s Note: Item Labels'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97530854897401887
    m_Localized: " Certain items can be relabeled. For example, you can label a counterfeit box of cigarettes as genuine to raise its price.\n\n Beware — most workers, Security Officers, and Lower Level citizens are familiar with common item fraud. Scam attempts will fail and result in a penalty to your Reputation.\n While Scavengers are also familiar with item fraud, they often don't carry the equipment required to test for authenticity, if any is needed.\n Tourists and Upper Level citizens, however, are generally less aware.\n But sooner or later, people will find out."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97530854897401888
    m_Localized: 'Mentor''s Note: Sentinel Collapse Disorder'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97530854897401889
    m_Localized: " I am sorry to hear that you have SCD... It's a serious health condition that you will live with for the rest of your life.\n You will need to take regular Immunivax shots or your health will deteriorate and suffer permanent damage. You can afford to miss a few days at the start, but the damage adds up over time."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97530854897401890
    m_Localized: Codeword List
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97530854897401891
    m_Localized: " \n The following codewords will be used in Marketplace Requests:\nUpcoming Operation, Birthday Party\n Oxymore Injector, Refreshment\n Raid, Gathering\nSafehouse, Garden\n Security Access Card, Housewarming Gift\n Extraction, Vacation\nCompromised, Decrepit\n High Priority Emergency, Last-Minute\n"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97530854897401892
    m_Localized: An inconspicuous slip of paper with a hastily written key for the code used by revolutionaries.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97530854897401893
    m_Localized: -The Mentor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97553554441289728
    m_Localized: Ribwich Appraisal Guide
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97553663073763328
    m_Localized: Base Value
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97553741188481024
    m_Localized: All Ribwichs start at 150 Credits. Different conditions can affect its price.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97553814270033920
    m_Localized: 1. Packaging, Counterfeit and Minimum Value
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97553878459662336
    m_Localized: 2. Production Date
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97554477146226688
    m_Localized: A limited edition sandwich from Davre. Now discontinued, it's price now steadily increasing due to people still eating it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97553856145965056
    m_Localized: "If the plastic packaging is missing, torn open or counterfeit, the final value will always be 40 credits regardless of anything else. \nRibwichs can't have a final value lower than 40 credits, regardless of any condition."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97553920436256768
    m_Localized: 'All Ribwichs will have their production date displayed on the packaging. The Ribwich were only ever produced on the following runs:'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97553955567747072
    m_Localized: "1st Production Run: January 425 - December 429\n2nd Production Run: January 432 - December 438"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97555086788313088
    m_Localized: The Ribwich produced on the very first month (01/425) and the very last month (12/438) are worth +50 Credits for historical reasons.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97555078433259520
    m_Localized: The first production run Ribwich were made using better material and are worth +80 Credits
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97555062360686592
    m_Localized: If the production date is missing, invalid or outside the range, then it is counterfeit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97556559559442432
    m_Localized: Davre used a number of facility to produce and package the Ribwich, some are known to have higher or lower quality control standard which can affect the Ribwich shelf life.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97556520833433600
    m_Localized: 3. Packing Facility
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97556791819026432
    m_Localized: "High Quality Packing Facility: 01, 02, 05, 08, 21, 34\nLow Quality Packing Facility: 07, 15, 18, 26, 31"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97556578551250944
    m_Localized: There's 35 total packing facilities that were used. If the packing facility number is missing or invalid, then the Ribwich is counterfeit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97556665188794368
    m_Localized: Ribwich from the high quality packing facility are worth +50 Credits
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97556679042580480
    m_Localized: Ribwich from the low quality packing facility are worth -50 Credits
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97556690048434176
    m_Localized: 'Example of a genuine Ribwich from the second production run:'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97558344047050752
    m_Localized: 4. Deluxe Edition
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97558370148204544
    m_Localized: Ribwich with sesame bun and extra pickles were also released along the normal Ribwich and was marketed as Deluxe Edition
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97558401722925056
    m_Localized: The Deluxe edition ribwich must have both the sesame bun and extra pickles. if only one is present then it is counterfeit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97558426083442688
    m_Localized: Valid deluxe edition are worth +300 Credits
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97558450448154624
    m_Localized: 5. Double Meat Patty
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97558478566768640
    m_Localized: In rare instances, it has been reported that Davre’s packing machine malfunctioned and produced Ribwiches with two meat patties. These Ribwiches are typically removed and destroyed by the quality control team, making double-patty Ribwiches extremely rare.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97558496883294208
    m_Localized: Valid double patty Ribwich are worth +800 Credits
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97558508056920064
    m_Localized: 6. Davre Logo
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97558545474306048
    m_Localized: All Ribwich must have the Davre Logo, if missing or incorrect, then it is counterfeit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97558562889056256
    m_Localized: 7. Ribwich Logo
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97558698344103936
    m_Localized: All 2nd production ribwich will have a Ribwich sticker, if missing or incorrect, then it is counterfeit. 1st production will not have the Ribwich sticker.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97559369936060416
    m_Localized: Plasma Cartridge Appraisal Guide
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97578536374419456
    m_Localized: "Plasma Cartridges are the standard fuel of the the Pulse Plasma Drive, a common installation on small-to-medium spacecraft.\nA result of high demand and light regulation, Plasma Cartridges are manufactured in sweatshops and industrial laboratories both. Where a Plasma Cartridge is made will affect its quality.\n\nThis guide will provide everything you need to know to appraise the value of any Plasma Cartridge."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97578620231139328
    m_Localized: ILLUSTRATION OF A PLASMA CARTRIDGE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97578666938908672
    m_Localized: "There are four common manufacturers on the Station:\n\n\t- Wild's Rides (\"WLD\"),\n\t- Republic Naval Requisition (\"RNR\"),\n\t- ZhongHua Shipbuilding (\"ZHS\"),\n\t- Ignition Lab (\"IGN\")"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97578677403697152
    m_Localized: Regardless of manufacturer or current condition, Plasma Cartridges have a base value of 300 Credits, and a minimum value of 90 Credits.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97578837257011200
    m_Localized: Cartridge Condition
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97578934199959552
    m_Localized: The value of a Plasma Cartridge is determined by its condition. The condition is the total sum of the cartridges attributes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97578995805896704
    m_Localized: Standard (No Change)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97579017947627520
    m_Localized: Light Wear (-45 Credits)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97579023517663232
    m_Localized: Heavy Wear (-90 Credits)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97579295308562432
    m_Localized: Cartridge Condition
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97579324266037248
    m_Localized: Cracked (-150 Credits)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97579339571052544
    m_Localized: Exposed Screws (-30 Credits)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97579346848169984
    m_Localized: Reinforced (+60 Credits)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97579654009634816
    m_Localized: Plasma Color
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97579702764224512
    m_Localized: "The color of the plasma is the biggest indicator of quality.\nAny color not Standard or High-Grade is regarded as Low-Grade."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97579718635470848
    m_Localized: Standard (No Change)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97579734468968448
    m_Localized: Low Grade Example (-150 Credits)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97579741716725760
    m_Localized: High-Grade (+150 Credits)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97579997401497600
    m_Localized: Cartridge Manufacturer
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97580560818159616
    m_Localized: Wild's Rides ("WLD")
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97580794755465216
    m_Localized: Possible Example
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97580685535789056
    m_Localized: "WLD Plasma Cartridges are manufactured in the Lower Levels, and are highly variable in quality.\nPossible Cartridge Condition: Any\nPossible Color: Low-Grade, Standard\nSeal: Always"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97580739558424576
    m_Localized: 'If ALL conditions match: +60 Credits'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97581029770706944
    m_Localized: ZhongHua Shipbuilding ("ZHS")
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97581052319285248
    m_Localized: "ZHS Plasma Cartridges have a more reasonable price point, but without compromising on quality.\n\nPossible Cartridge Condition: None or Reinforced\nPossible Color: Standard\nSeal: Always"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97581069801144320
    m_Localized: 'If ALL conditions match: +120 Credits'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97581604390354944
    m_Localized: Correct Configuration
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97581588955316224
    m_Localized: 'If ALL conditions match: +750 Credits'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97581576204632064
    m_Localized: "A specialized R&D lab, IGN Plasma Cartridges are manufactured to the highest possible grade.\nPossible Cartridge Condition: None\nPossible Color:  High-Grade\nSeal: Always"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97581555937755136
    m_Localized: Ignition Lab ("IGN")
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97581540766957568
    m_Localized: 'If ALL conditions match: +120 Credits'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97581527986913280
    m_Localized: "Funded by the Republic itself, RNR Plasma Cartridges are typically retrieved and recycled.\n\nPossible Cartridge Condition: Any, Except Cracks\nPossible Color: Standard\nSeal: Always"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97581506910535680
    m_Localized: Republic Naval Requisition ("RNR")
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97582745979240448
    m_Localized: Water Trading Manual
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97583244593905664
    m_Localized: 1. Grading
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97583389582606336
    m_Localized: 'The quality of water is determined by its purity:'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97583739890876416
    m_Localized: Pure Water (99.9%+)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97583769452331008
    m_Localized: High-Quality (99%-99.9%)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97583797470281728
    m_Localized: Basewater (98%-99%)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97583810321629184
    m_Localized: Ghostwater (96%-98%)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97583830152298496
    m_Localized: Rustwater (90%-96%)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97583849882304512
    m_Localized: Gutterflow (90%-)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97583541718401024
    m_Localized: Safe to drink
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97583590137446400
    m_Localized: Consume if necessary, prolonged use not advised
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97583638321610752
    m_Localized: Unsafe and risky for human consumption
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97583660907937792
    m_Localized: 'Warning: Highly Toxic, Do Not Consume'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97585811071746048
    m_Localized: 2. Identification
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97585845494398976
    m_Localized: Water sold on the station may not be labeled correctly, whether intentionally or not. Always verify water quality before purchase and consumption.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97585867443191808
    m_Localized: A Water Testing Strip is a cheap and easy way to test the purity of water.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97586321032003584
    m_Localized: 3. Purification
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97587194655195136
    m_Localized: "Water on the station can contains multiple types of contaminants. Each method of purification is effective against only certain types of contaminants.\n\nIf repeated attempts do not improve the water's purity, your chosen purification method cannot remove the remaining contaminants in the water."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97587213072384000
    m_Localized: Water Purification Tablets reduce chemical contaminants first, then eliminate microbial contaminants with what remains. One tablet is enough for a large bottle of Rustwater; dirtier water may require several.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97587223478452224
    m_Localized: "Water Filter: When installed inside a pitcher, it filters water as it is poured in.\nIt removes impurities, microplastics, and organic waste. Filters have limited durability."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97587234954067968
    m_Localized: Using Purification Tablets and a Water Filter together should bring most water up to Basewater, or even High-Quality Water, depending on the initial purity. Heavily contaminated water may require several tablets.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97587251731283968
    m_Localized: To reach Pure Water, a dedicated Water Purifier with properly installed Modules is required.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97587259113259008
    m_Localized: Purifying Gutterflow using basic purification methods is not recommended, as it rapidly degrades Water Filter durability.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97587744406814720
    m_Localized: 4. Types of Water
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97589248253542400
    m_Localized: Hard to procure even for those living on the Upper Levels. Incredibly expensive and used primarily in sensitive environments like Hospitals and Laboratories. In Upper Levels societies, offering pure water to guests demonstrates high social status.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97589392676012032
    m_Localized: The standard on the Upper Levels. Safe for drinking, cooking, and most household uses, it is more accessible but still costly.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97589410753462272
    m_Localized: The standard for Lower Levels. Adequate for short-term use, but prolonged exposure can contribute to development of chronic disease.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97589447902412800
    m_Localized: "Indistinguishable by eye from other higher quality water, yet unsafe to drink unfiltered. Ghostwater is most commonly used in farming and industry.\n<b>The sale of mislabeled Ghostwater is a common scam in the Lower Levels.</b>"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97589459784876032
    m_Localized: "Unsuitable for farming, and dangerous to drink.\n\t<b>Can be identified visually.</b>"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97589471994494976
    m_Localized: "Heavily contaminated and toxic. Seek immediate medical attention if consumed. \n\t<b>Can be visually identified.</b>"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97589767374159872
    m_Localized: 5. Common Water Trading Scams
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97589894516097024
    m_Localized: Rustwater and Gutterflow
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97589953840332800
    m_Localized: Rustwater and Gutterflow are harder to mislabel since they are visually distinguishable from other types of water by color.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97589976489574400
    m_Localized: Ghostwater
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97589998794883072
    m_Localized: The sale of Ghostwater mislabeled as Basewater is a common scam in the Lower Levels. Selling large volume of mislabeled Ghostwater is a crime.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97590016012500992
    m_Localized: Customer Behaviour
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97590039429300224
    m_Localized: "Scavengers are typically too poor to carry a Water Testing Kit.\nSome Citizens of the Lower Levels and Scavengers will not buy Pure Water.\nTourists and Upper Level Citizens are often too oblivious to test the purity of the water they buy.\nCustomers requesting large amounts of water will typically carry a Water Testing Kit."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97593349360107520
    m_Localized: Hydroponic Farming Manual
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97593399297490944
    m_Localized: Quick Start Guide
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97593457183080448
    m_Localized: "'1. Insert a filled water container with Ghostwater or Basewater.\n2. Add some Minerals to make sure there''s enough nutrient.\n3. Insert power source and seed.\n4. After a day or two, the farm should be ready for harvest."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97593494038429696
    m_Localized: Add water and replace the energy cell as needed to ensure that hydroponic keep running!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97593544877588480
    m_Localized: Tips for Novices Farmers
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97593590079602688
    m_Localized: "Start learning hydroponic by farming Nutrifruit. It is genetically modified to be an easy to farm crop.\n\nMake sure to keep enough clean water and add a nutriment tablet to the water when the yield decrease."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97593921744191488
    m_Localized: Advanced Guide
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97593996276973568
    m_Localized: 'Water Quality:'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97594053361451008
    m_Localized: 'Certain contaminants can harm the plant''s growth. Make sure to use water with a low concentration of contaminants, unless you farming a crop with particular needs. (NOTE: Minerals are NOT contaminants.)'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97594074400079872
    m_Localized: 'Nutrient:'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97594109267329024
    m_Localized: Plants require Minerals to grow. Too little or too much can have negative impact on the yield. Each plant has specific nutrient concentration tolerance. Usually, it's better to have too much Minerals than not enough.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97594128330440704
    m_Localized: 'Plant Analyser:'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97594182365659136
    m_Localized: Can be used on a seed to check its needs and their current health.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97595269432786944
    m_Localized: Chemistry 101 Guide
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97595449448120320
    m_Localized: Tools and Machines
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97595523578249216
    m_Localized: Chemical Supplies
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97595595292459008
    m_Localized: Can be unpack to obtain various essential chemicals
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97595998973247488
    m_Localized: Composition Spectrometer (Chem Scanner)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97596026353664000
    m_Localized: Use it on liquid container or chemical product to see their composition
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97596200966733824
    m_Localized: Blender
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97596256537067520
    m_Localized: Can be upgraded to improve extraction yield
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97596274690015232
    m_Localized: Heating Plate
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97596300736643072
    m_Localized: Can be upgraded to improve max temperature, temperature control and heating speed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97597227497472000
    m_Localized: Evaporator
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97597248573849600
    m_Localized: Work overnight to remove certain liquid such as water and alcohol. Use normal modules
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97597267469189120
    m_Localized: Chem Finisher
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97597291829706752
    m_Localized: Can be upgraded to reduce the amount of impurity introduced
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97597525024620544
    m_Localized: Unlike other machines, most of the machine related to chemistry can only be upgraded with the special Chemical Equipment Module.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97597821708713984
    m_Localized: Dream Dust
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97598475139334144
    m_Localized: 'Step 1: Ingredient Prep'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97598541489029120
    m_Localized: "- Attach a liquid container to the Blender\n- Add a few Dream Cap\n- Blend the ingredient to get Dream Cap Mush"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97598561487470592
    m_Localized: 'Step 2: Extraction'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97598580814823424
    m_Localized: "- Take the container from the previous step\n- Insert it into the Heating Plate\n- Add solvent (Alcohol) equal to 3-6 time the volume of Dream Cap Mush\n- Heat the mixure to 40-60C to turn Dream Cap Mush into Dream Cap Extract"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97598598804193280
    m_Localized: Do not overheat or Dream Cap will be destroyed
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97598620887203840
    m_Localized: 'Step 3: Evaporation'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97598636930416640
    m_Localized: "- (Optional) Filter the solution from the previous step with a Kotton Fabric as filter to remove large sized contaminants\n- Insert the container into the Evaporator\n- Make sure the Evaporator is powered with a Energy Cell\n- Wait until the next day for the Evaporator to work"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97598650855505920
    m_Localized: 'Step 4: Packaging'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97598681629114368
    m_Localized: "- (REQUIRED) When all the water and alcohol has evaporated, insert the container into the Chem Finisher\n- Select Dream Dust as the recipe\n- Press the \"Output\" button \n- (Optional) Check purity with a Composition Spectrometer"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97599907884220416
    m_Localized: Caffeine Pill Recipe
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97601984458964992
    m_Localized: 'Step 1: Ingredient Prep'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97602024158052352
    m_Localized: "- Attach a liquid container to the Blender\n- Add a few Coffee Beans\n- Blend the ingredient to get Coffee Beans Mush"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97602038418685952
    m_Localized: 'Step 2: Extraction'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97602053216190464
    m_Localized: "- Take the container from the previous step\n- Insert it into the Heating Plate\n- (Optional but Recommended) Add solvent (Alcohol) equal to 3-6 time the volume of Coffee Bean Mush\n- Heat the mixture to a minimum of 80C"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97602068449902592
    m_Localized: 'Note: Caffeine is very heat resistance'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97602088817442816
    m_Localized: 'Step 3: Evaporation'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97602105129091072
    m_Localized: "- (Optional) Filter the solution from the previous step with a Kotton Fabric as filter to remove large sized contaminants\n- Insert the container into the Evaporator\n- Make sure the Evaporator is powered with a Energy Cell\n- Wait until the next day for the Evaporator to work"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97602117913329664
    m_Localized: 'Step 4: Packaging'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97602136741560320
    m_Localized: "- (REQUIRED) When all the water and alcohol has evaporated, insert the container into the Chem Finisher\n- Select Caffeine Pill as the recipe\n- Press the \"Output\" button \n- (Optional) Check purity with a Composition Spectrometer"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97602620424503296
    m_Localized: Phanta Pill Information
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97602698144956416
    m_Localized: The precise recipe for Phanta remains a closely guarded secret. What follows is a compilation of publicly available information.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97603346156535808
    m_Localized: Base Ingredient
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97603389408198656
    m_Localized: N-Methylol Base is a known precursor of Phanta. It can be found in Restricted Chemical Supplies
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97603407972188160
    m_Localized: Preparation
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97603424577437696
    m_Localized: The N-Methylol Base will contain a Stabilizing Agent to protect the chemical from degradation but also prevent chemical reaction. It must be somehow removed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97603439643377664
    m_Localized: Reaction
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97603456760332288
    m_Localized: "We now need a substance that can donate electrons to the N-Methylol Base to transform it chemically into Phanta. \n\nWe suspect this process must also be done at high temperature requiring an upgraded Heating Plate"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97603474208636928
    m_Localized: Packaging
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97603490314764288
    m_Localized: After that, filter the solution and package it as usual.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97603523869196288
    m_Localized: 'WARNING: PHANTA WILL DEGRADE ABOVE 130°C'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97604487388905472
    m_Localized: Chemistry Purity Rating
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97604571547615232
    m_Localized: Some customers will carry Chem Scanner to verify the labeled purity of your products.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97604774765838336
    m_Localized: Pure Grade (99%+)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97604854067544064
    m_Localized: Pharma Grade (90-99%)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97604877522092032
    m_Localized: Near Pharma (80-90%)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97605855394709504
    m_Localized: Street Standard (60-80%)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97605903411101696
    m_Localized: Cut Product (45-60%)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97606068243054592
    m_Localized: Junk Grade (30-45%)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97606095426338816
    m_Localized: Starch Grade (30%-)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97607396725932032
    m_Localized: +135% of Base Value
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97607458839379968
    m_Localized: +85% of Base Value
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97607466187800576
    m_Localized: +40% of Base Value
    m_Metadata:
