  - m_Id: 103435254446735360
    m_Localized: Borderless Fullscreen
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 103435254446735361
    m_Localized: Windowed
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 103435254446735362
    m_Localized: Recommended
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96069631127371776
    m_Localized: Lottery Prizes
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 113902867563986944
    m_Localized: 'Mentor''s Note: The Augmented'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 113902867589152768
    m_Localized: The Augs are humans overtaken by a rogue AI inside a brain implant. Their bodies are no longer their own, and there is currently no safe way to remove the implant without killing the host. Augs are hostile and extremely dangerous, actively seeking to kidnap people and install more Augmentation implants. Shopkeepers are the first line of defense, since Augs rely on raw materials to fabricate new implants and medical supplies to surgically implant more victims. They haven't fully mastered normal human behavior and may also use overly formal phrasing or robotic vocabulary. Shoot only if you are absolutely certain. Do not try to call Security, the Augs have hacked their comms and will flee before Security arrives.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 121794940631826432
    m_Localized: Page {0}/{1}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 121794940661186560
    m_Localized: 'WARNING: IF CONSUMED GUTTERFLOW, SEEK IMMEDIATE MEDICAL ATTENTION'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 123280221805527040
    m_Localized: Buying
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 124710930575310848
    m_Localized: Redeem all winning lottery tickets into Credits (Not Commissary Tokens)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 125432946643222528
    m_Localized: Clientele
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 125432946680971264
    m_Localized: Open the Clientele Interface
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 125432946680971265
    m_Localized: Expected Buyers From Displayed Merchandise
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 125432946680971266
    m_Localized: Expected Normal Customers ({0})
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 125432946680971267
    m_Localized: Customers will appear depending on the conditions of the Store when the Shutter Door is opened.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 125432946680971268
    m_Localized: The condition of your store will attract a number of random customers each day. Certain special items stored in the Display Case can influence which customers appear. Each of the following customers can appear once per day. Remaining slots will be filled with random customers.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 125452799789809664
    m_Localized: Most merchandise stored inside the Display Case will attract buyers. Buyers' budget depend on the value of the stored merchandise.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 125452799794003968
    m_Localized: No merchandise detected inside the display case.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 125454821289148416
    m_Localized: Random Customer
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 125458918834749440
    m_Localized: Buyer
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 126544338016321536
    m_Localized: Seller
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 126616720672342016
    m_Localized: This customer will only buy each item once, but will pay a premium.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 126616720672342017
    m_Localized: This customer will not accept any contraband.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 126616720672342018
    m_Localized: This customer is part of Station Security. Showing them Stolen or Contraband items may have consequences.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 126624901758763008
    m_Localized: Keeps the store lit and grid devices running. If unpaid, only Machines that run on Energy Cells will function. Lights inside the store will dim.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 126847250407931904
    m_Localized: If paid, any items stolen during the night will be returned to you the next morning.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 126847250441486336
    m_Localized: If paid, the trash can will be emptied and the storefront will be cleaned. If the storefront is left unclean for multiple days, the store's attractiveness will decrease. If the store is currently vandalized, the cleaning cost will be higher.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 127279034018873344
    m_Localized: Store Attractiveness is affected by how recently the Janitor cleaned the storefront, and by certain machines and upgrades.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 127279034052427776
    m_Localized: Reputation with a faction can be gained by trading with their members. Trading with special customers grants increased reputation. Reporting a customer to Security may result in lost reputation with their faction.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 127290448741711872
    m_Localized: 'Certain items can have labels, which can be edited. Use this to label items honestly, or to mislabel them and sell at a higher price. Beware: different customers are better or worse at spotting mislabeled goods. If you are caught selling an item worth less than its label, your reputation may take a hit.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 127290448741711873
    m_Localized: The customer claims this item is genuine and in working condition. Use this panel to confront them if you find any sign that it's counterfeit or broken. One issue is enough. If you are wrong, your reputation may take a hit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 127290448741711874
    m_Localized: The customer is selling this item and claims it's counterfeit or broken. If you believe they're wrong, use this panel to say so. They will raise their asking price accordingly and grant you reputation.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 127545175467409408
    m_Localized: 'Estimate Sent: {0}'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 127545175496769536
    m_Localized: 'True Value: {0}'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 127569025076871168
    m_Localized: Appraisal Item
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 127569025110425600
    m_Localized: "Base Value: +300\nCracks: -150\nReinforced: +60\nNo Manufacturer Bonus (Can't have cracks): +0 \n----------------------\n<b>Total: 210</b>"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 127569025110425601
    m_Localized: "Base Value: +300\nHeavy Wears: -90\nExposed Screws: -30\nLow Grade Color: -150\n------------------\nSubtotal: 30\n------------------\nThis item cannot go below 90\n<b>Final Value: 90</b>"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 127570132838694912
    m_Localized: Appraisal Example
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 131679029870510080
    m_Localized: When disabled, dialogue text appears instantly instead of typing out.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 131679029870510081
    m_Localized: When disabled, dialogue does not advance automatically. Press Space to continue to the next line.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 131684622186364928
    m_Localized: Dialogue and Typewriter Settings
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 131684622186364929
    m_Localized: These settings can be changed at any time in the Game Options menu.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 131947430014664704
    m_Localized: 'Attracted By:'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 131947430056607744
    m_Localized: '{0} in the Display Case'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 133010627870113792
    m_Localized: Bargain
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 133010627912056832
    m_Localized: 'Selling: Offer Discount'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 133010627912056833
    m_Localized: 'Buying: Demand Discount'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 133010627912056834
    m_Localized: 'Selling: Add Markup'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 133010627912056835
    m_Localized: 'Buying: Offer Markup'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 133010627912056836
    m_Localized: Blackmail (Criminal)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 133010627912056837
    m_Localized: Threaten (Aug)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 133010627912056838
    m_Localized: Reputation Multiplier
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 133010627912056839
    m_Localized: Offer a discount when selling to this customer. Grants additional reputation on each item sold and increases customer budget.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 133010627912056840
    m_Localized: Demand a discount when buying from this customer. Costs reputation on each item bought if successful. Success depends on your faction reputation.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 133010627912056841
    m_Localized: Charge extra when selling to this customer, reducing their total budget and costing additional reputation on each item sold. Success depends on your current reputation.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 133010627912056842
    m_Localized: Pay extra when buying from this customer. Grants additional reputation on each item purchased.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 133010627912056843
    m_Localized: Threaten to report this customer to Security unless they offer better prices when trading. Always fails on non-criminal customers.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 133010627912056844
    m_Localized: Accuse this customer of being an Aug and threaten to shoot them, demanding better prices when trading. If attempted on a normal customer, the accusation will always fail and you will lose reputation.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 133010627912056845
    m_Localized: This multiplier determines the rate at which faction reputation is gained or lost when trading with this customer.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 133010627912056846
    m_Localized: Estimated reputation gained or lost with this customer's faction for every 1,000 Credits traded.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 135547655149109248
    m_Localized: Cybernetic Hand Appraisal Guide
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 135547655178469376
    m_Localized: Cybernetic hands vary widely on the Station, and so do their prices. This guide will help determine the fair market value of any cybernetic hand.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 135547655178469377
    m_Localized: Base Value and Minimum Value
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 135547655178469378
    m_Localized: All cybernetic hands start at 100 Credits. Various conditions can affect their price. Regardless of condition, the minimum value of a cybernetic hand is 50 Credits.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 135547655178469379
    m_Localized: 1. Material
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 135547655178469380
    m_Localized: Aluminum Alloy
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 135547655178469381
    m_Localized: Carbon Composite
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 135547655178469382
    m_Localized: Gold Plated
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 135547655178469383
    m_Localized: 2. Condition
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 135547655178469384
    m_Localized: None
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 135547655178469385
    m_Localized: Wears
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 135547655178469386
    m_Localized: Damages
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 135547655178469387
    m_Localized: 3. Control Interface
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 135547655178469388
    m_Localized: Neural Interface
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 135547655178469389
    m_Localized: Unspecified
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 135547655178469390
    m_Localized: 4. Add-ons
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 135547655178469391
    m_Localized: Armored
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 135547655178469392
    m_Localized: Blade
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 135547655178469393
    m_Localized: Add-ons bonus are independent and each can apply.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 135547655178469394
    m_Localized: 5. Set Bonus
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 135547655178469395
    m_Localized: Specific combinations of cybernetic hands can increase their value.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 135547655178469396
    m_Localized: "Tactical:\n- Carbon Composite\n- EMG+ or Neural Interface\n- No wear or damage\n- Armored and blade"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 135547655178469397
    m_Localized: "Deluxe:\n- Gold Plated\n- Neural Interface\n- No wear or damage\n- With or without any add-ons"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 135547655178469398
    m_Localized: Examples
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 135547655178469399
    m_Localized: "Base: +100\nCarbon Composite: +50\nWear: -35\nEMG+: +45\nTotal: 160 Credits"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 135547655178469400
    m_Localized: "Base: +100\nDamage: -85\nUnspecified Control: -60\nSubtotal: -45 Credits\nCANNOT GO BELOW 50 CREDITS\nTotal: 50 Credits\n"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 135589004225331200
    m_Localized: Water quality affects wine quality. Use High Quality Water or Basewater. Pure Water lacks the minerals needed for fermentation. Lower grades of water will greatly reduce wine quality.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 135589004225331201
    m_Localized: Standard yeast is optional but highly recommended. Without it, wild yeast from the air will ferment the wine instead, producing inconsistent results. Standard yeast also greatly accelerates fermentation.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 135589004225331202
    m_Localized: Berry quality is the most important factor. One handful is enough for lower-grade wine. Two handfuls are necessary for high-grade wine. Avoid overripe, underripe, or moldy berries. The best berries for winemaking are usually smaller than normal.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 135589004225331203
    m_Localized: BloomBerry Identification
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 135589004225331204
    m_Localized: Normal
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
