  - m_Id: 172529243283832832
    m_Localized: Quick Dial
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 179814690208923648
    m_Localized: Open and close containers, examine, select and toggle items with one click instead of a double click. Activation keeps its own setting below.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
