    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 180502134231187459
    m_Localized: Unsubscribe Selected
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 180502134231187460
    m_Localized: Auto-Sort Mods
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 180502134231187461
    m_Localized: Reorder the active mods so each one loads after the mods it depends on? Your current order will be replaced.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 180502134231187462
    m_Localized: Unsubscribe from '{0}'? Steam removes its files and the mod is gone after the next restart.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 180502134231187463
    m_Localized: Reset to Defaults
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 180502134231187464
    m_Localized: Mods are made by other players, not by Questing Goose Studio or tinyBuild. A mod can contain code that runs with the same access to your computer as the game itself. The game checks mods before activation, but cannot make them safe. Only activate mods from authors you trust. You use mods at your own risk. Questing Goose Studio and tinyBuild are not responsible for any damage, data loss or other harm caused by a mod, and cannot support problems that occur while mods are active.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 180502134231187465
    m_Localized: Mod changes take effect after the game restarts.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
