      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 188903740813688837
    m_Localized: it tried to use your Steam account in a way mods are never allowed to ({0})
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 188903740813688838
    m_Localized: it tried to start another program, which mods are never allowed to do
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 188903740813688839
    m_Localized: 'Stopped and deactivated by the game: {0}. Delete or unsubscribe this mod, and change your Steam password if it ran on this computer.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 188903740813688840
    m_Localized: '{0} was stopped by the game on this computer because {1}. This version cannot be enabled again.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 189286048303202304
    m_Localized: 'Lou''s thank-you gift: pick one.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 189289306782482432
    m_Localized: Characters inspired by pop culture, such as the Case Enjoyer and the Foodie Tourist, no longer visit the store.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 189289306782482433
    m_Localized: Items you buy or get in a barter go straight into your inventory. When off, they stay on the counter. Items that do not fit always stay on the counter.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 189289306782482434
    m_Localized: 'Not installed from the Steam Workshop: its upload date and ratings cannot be verified.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 189289306782482435
