    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 189289306782482453
    m_Localized: Size of the speech bubbles, name tags and reply choices in the store and on the phone. 100% is the normal size.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 189702702328123392
    m_Localized: '{0} asks for these capabilities:'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 189702702328123393
    m_Localized: A mod with these capabilities can do anything on this computer that you can. Only activate mods from authors you trust.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 189702702328123394
    m_Localized: Only activate mods from authors you trust.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 190128458793009152
    m_Localized: When the game comes back from Alt-Tab as a small window instead of fullscreen, it switches back to the fullscreen mode you chose. Turn this off if the screen stays black after Alt-Tab, for example on Linux.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
